d, busty maid with beautiful long sharp eyes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a typical tsundere and acts as if she hates Shiki like a snake. She seems quiet and obedient to the outside world, as if she thinks she can't help it if she gets out of line."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was raised well and can handle the housework in the mansion without difficulty, though not as well as Reize. She is patient when it comes to being abused, and can endure a great deal of pain even if it is inflicted on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She calls Reize by her first name, and struggles calling Shiki \"master\". She refers to her parents with \"father and \"mother\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140388"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"切れ長の美しい目をした、金髪碧眼の爆乳メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"典型的なツンデレで、シキのことを蛇蝎のごとく嫌っているように振舞う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暴れてもしょうがないと思っているのか、対外的には大人しく従順に見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ちが良く、邸内の家事など、レイゼほどではないがわりと卒なくこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"被虐に関しては我慢強く、相当な苦痛を与えられても耐え抜いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"レイゼは呼び捨て、シキはなかなかご主人様と呼べず、父母はお父さん、お母さん。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26674","sourceWorkId":"36811","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"切れ長の美しい目をした、金髪碧眼の爆乳メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"典型的なツンデレで、シキのことを蛇蝎のごとく嫌っているように振舞う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暴れてもしょうがないと思っているのか、対外的には大人しく従順に見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ちが良く、邸内の家事など、レイゼほどではないがわりと卒なくこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"被虐に関しては我慢強く、相当な苦痛を与えられても耐え抜いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"レイゼは呼び捨て、シキはなかなかご主人様と呼べず、父母はお父さん、お母さん。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"169928"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"108 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26674","sourceWorkId":"36811","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"m","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26674","sourceWorkId":"36811","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","val